  "tips": "**Menyapa di chat kerja (Slack, Teams, grup WhatsApp)**\n\n- *Hi team!* = Halo tim!\n- *Good morning, everyone!* = Selamat pagi, semuanya!\n- *How is it going?* = Bagaimana kabarnya? (bisa juga: gimana progresnya?)\n- *Welcome to the team!* = Selamat bergabung di tim!\n- *Quick question.* = Mau tanya sebentar.\n\nSantai atau sopan? *Hi* dan *Hey* untuk chat santai. *Good morning* sedikit lebih sopan.\n\nBentuk singkat: *How is it going?* → *How's it going?*\n\n**everyone** dihitung satu, jadi pakai **is**:\n*Everyone are here* ✗ → *Everyone is here* ✓",
